# ======================================================================
#  BLOG — COMMIT MESSAGE TEMPLATE
# ======================================================================
#
# FORMAT
#
#   type(scope): concise summary
#
# EXAMPLES
#
#   feat(blog): add tag filtering
#   fix(layout): prevent mobile overflow
#   refactor(routes): simplify slug parsing
#   style(post): improve prose spacing
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# COMMIT TYPES
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# feat       introduce a new feature
# fix        resolve a bug or regression
# refactor   restructure code without changing behavior
# style      visual/UI/CSS formatting changes
# perf       improve performance
# docs       documentation-only changes
# test       add or update tests
# build      build tooling, adapters, bundling
# ci         CI/CD workflows and automation
# chore      maintenance, cleanup, dependencies
# revert     revert a previous commit
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# RECOMMENDED SCOPES
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# blog       blog engine/content system
# post       post rendering/prose components
# ui         reusable UI components
# layout     layouts/navigation/structure
# seo        metadata/rss/sitemap/opengraph
# mdsvex     markdown/mdsvex configuration
# routes     SvelteKit routing/pages
# api        server routes/endpoints
# auth       authentication/admin access
# stores     Svelte stores/state handling
# theme      dark mode/themes/design tokens
# search     search indexing/filtering
# config     vite/svelte/tailwind configuration
# deploy     deployment/infrastructure
# content    writing/posts/static content
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUMMARY GUIDELINES
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# - use imperative mood
#     ✓ add dark mode toggle
#     ✓ improve article typography
#     ✗ added dark mode toggle
#
# - keep summary short
#     ideal: <= 72 characters
#
# - describe WHAT changed, not HOW
#
# - use lowercase unless proper nouns are required
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL BODY
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Explain:
# - why the change was needed
# - architectural decisions
# - edge cases
# - migration notes
# - tradeoffs
#
# Example:
#
# fix(mdsvex): resolve hydration mismatch in code blocks
#
# Replaced rehype-prism with shiki because SSR output
# differed from client-side rendering on highlighted lines.
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL FOOTER
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Closes #123
# Related #98
# BREAKING CHANGE: changed post frontmatter schema
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXAMPLE COMMITS
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# feat(blog): add related posts section
# feat(search): implement client-side article indexing
# fix(seo): generate canonical urls correctly
# fix(layout): prevent horizontal scroll on mobile
# refactor(ui): extract reusable article header
# style(post): improve code block readability
# perf(blog): preload adjacent article navigation
# chore(config): upgrade sveltekit to latest version
#
# ======================================================================
